  "content": "![FullbrightUtils](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/FullbrightUtils/refs/heads/main/README/minecraft_title.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fweigel-dev/FullbrightUtils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/FullbrightUtils/refs/heads/main/README/github_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px;\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fullbrightutils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/FullbrightUtils/refs/heads/main/README/modrinth_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px;\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fullbrightutils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/FullbrightUtils/refs/heads/main/README/curseforge_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px;\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 40px 0;\">\n  <div>\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">支援版本：</h3>\n    <img width=\"165\" height=\"84\" alt=\"Minecraft 26.1\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/FullbrightUtils/refs/heads/main/README/26.1.png\"/>\n    <img width=\"165\" height=\"84\" alt=\"Minecraft 26.2\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/FullbrightUtils/refs/heads/main/README/26.2.png\"/>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\nFullbrightUtils 是一款客戶端 Fabric 模組，讓您全面掌控 Minecraft 中的亮度與視覺效果：伽瑪值強化、夜視、抗黑暗效果與抗失明效果，全部可透過設定畫面進行調整。",
